WEBVTT

00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:06.979
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:08.145 --> 00:00:11.402
<v><b>F:</b></v> Their shopping trolley was piled high with tinned food.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:14.314
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:18.471
<v><b>M:</b></v> I chopped some peppers and onions to serve with the mussels.

00:00:20.566 --> 00:00:21.362
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:22.293 --> 00:00:26.637
<v><b>M:</b></v> She picked at the chicken nuggets and pushed the cabbage and carrots round the plate.

00:00:28.672 --> 00:00:29.397
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:34.747
<v><b>F:</b></v> The rabbit hopped over and ate some lettuce out of my hand.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:37.728
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:38.816 --> 00:00:41.844
<v><b>M:</b></v> He sniffed the curry powder before adding it to the sauce.

00:00:44.273 --> 00:00:45.101
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:46.327 --> 00:00:51.059
<v><b>M:</b></v> My favourite breakfast is waffles and honey, or eggs with grilled bacon.